#: scenario3:scenario3_408A4EAD_D6DF_42EE_B1F0_59E5E31418C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9c92938a1f86e4901e0241eb5a2b6c6cfc237ffa3c67b75d5e4a9bb73651df2a
#. default-sha256: cff82820cac282bf6728caabec189c8b51a9abd41fa87eaf1069fe598ad59cdc
