msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahahaha... ⟪k:1⟫I ⟪k:2⟫love⟪k:3⟫ that look on your face!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫I’m guessing you didn’t "
"make things better, then?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahahaha... ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Adoro⟪k:3⟫ quella faccia!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Deduco che le cose non siano andate "
"per il verso giusto, eh?"

#: scenario3:scenario3_91F838AB_E2A8_4777_AF54_F0769624E82D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f17b84c83b457a614b414d24b3d96ef42d4ca27655658d2b2f52985c986610b
