msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_91F838AB_E2A8_4777_AF54_F0769624E82D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You know... ⟪k:1⟫good and well!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫That she’s not even here anymore!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Lo sai... ⟪k:1⟫meglio di me!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Se n’è andata!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BBF97309_8CC3_4DD8_854E_AE3C9466564C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd1ab829c99218c089c1cfb4bab2da0941b73c53c24135731506de66a18604b1
#. default-sha256: 9777db349a1154d1b7f884af680638b263b70c747c3616e2e15e014259bca462
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BBF97309_8CC3_4DD8_854E_AE3C9466564C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Well, yeah, but I still wanna hear ⟪k:1⟫you⟪k:2⟫ say it, y’know?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sì, è vero... ⟪k:1⟫ma sai, volevo comunque ⟪k:2⟫sentirtelo dire⟪k:3⟫."

#: scenario3:scenario3_D0928CDF_1AAF_4059_8987_0C6AC9575F43
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeac39f24ba2cda61bf41d7df890971bb68f1c4dccbb13116cf5320935cad364
#. default-sha256: cf5883a92dbe57f91912a36226c402bf18ed12b60613c939ba8804453174934f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D0928CDF_1AAF_4059_8987_0C6AC9575F43"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I wanna hear from your own mouth that you couldn’t keep a leash on your woman, so you locked "
"her up, drove her mad, broke her down, and then she ran away from you!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Voglio sentir uscire dalla tua stessa bocca che non sei stato capace⟪k:1⟫di tenere al "
"guinzaglio la tua donna, e che l’hai rinchiusa, l’hai fatta impazzire, l’hai fatta crollare e poi "
"l’hai costretta a scappare!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E6575BA5_BF0A_4A3B_90BC_24E503078983
