msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pffft, ⟪k:1⟫baha, ⟪k:2⟫hahahaha...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Go on, say something.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Climb back on "
"your high horse and start shouting like you always do!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pffff, ⟪k:1⟫baha, ⟪k:2⟫hahahaha...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Dai su, dì qualcosa.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Torna sul tuo "
"piedistallo e inizia a sbraitare come fai sempre!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_078459F9_FCF3_4B09_BC1F_758E509223B2
