#: scenario3:scenario3_17D4883B_50CA_4CDD_BC6E_79BE38110923
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62266b564e73b8a69bc52caa5c044abd6734955991ae7d9d75de57aa70ea5e68
#. default-sha256: fc20a1ff0ff6badecd308478a68efe78eb0237a857dc3b3d0da24ddd33916203
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_17D4883B_50CA_4CDD_BC6E_79BE38110923"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’d been trying to figure out how I wanted to end things,⟪k:1⟫but then they just fell apart "
"on their own!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The fates are smiling down upon me, I guess."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Avrei dovuto pensare a un modo per chiudere la faccenda,⟪k:1⟫ma poi tutto è crollato senza "
"che io facessi niente!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Il destino mi arride, suppongo."

#: scenario3:scenario3_B32415B3_4781_4156_8438_980EBF5EEB06
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a9a5084ccfdc116e646702d8185c02aadfc612565d2e2f68becf5e5e1e8d17a0
#. default-sha256: ea1927b773a2060cb2da6d230b6ab2ad06fae0fb042d03a08a5197284e3acbd3
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B32415B3_4781_4156_8438_980EBF5EEB06"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonsense!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She was ⟪k:3⟫waiting⟪k:4⟫ for me!⟪k:5⟫Until the day of the joining "
"ceremony!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Stronzate!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Lei mi stava aspettando!⟪k:3⟫Fino al giorno dell’inaugurazione!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_74FEB0BA_DF3D_4B4B_9CF3_6D6C99B316E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1f26f1989e092497f6e78182d9e79b453293d1a12422fcbfd1d1f39d107e4e21
#. default-sha256: e4d92c63e5ee3d8b0ac3d5c6fbb54f7a0661e91584e59d35a5e7874a43e81e69
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_74FEB0BA_DF3D_4B4B_9CF3_6D6C99B316E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I was going to see her on that day!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You knew the ceremony had been postponed!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E quel giorno l’avrei rivista!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tu sapevi che la cerimonia era stata posticipata!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 872a910b5c9f79c95dfdac0f09a734d75ffd13b6de584b17a1342030e58716e0
#. default-sha256: 55daaa3f26ec3765912b5cda8ad0593ed819a9d957da62ec92fd93311fc9006f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B308381D_45D0_43B4_B42A_3BD6AC1A950E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That’s what you get for putting it all in my hands.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫For thinking I’m the only one "
"on your side!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questo è ciò che ti meriti per avermi affidato ogni cosa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Per aver pensato che io "
"stessi dalla tua parte!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f2f3128738ab1ad52b7417c44dd788f67b2dfcb1884e12d869cce5ff55ead591
#. default-sha256: 2c7dda1ce192f1e3d4d329693ebd4fd248ce829918663aae33946639a25b76c2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3772CF40_5419_4C29_BF90_777C82D925CC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What, did you think I’d just ⟪k:1⟫tell her⟪k:2⟫ like a good little maid?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Not a "
"chance in ⟪k:6⟫hell⟪k:7⟫!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Beh, cosa credevi? Che le avrei detto tutto come una brava servetta?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Col "
"cazzo⟪k:5⟫!"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2382AE51_E38B_46FF_A150_DB470F0C78E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 00e45a095961e1633ec6209d15bca708f79f73246639d40c92d8a9f7e165afcb
#. default-sha256: 336465f0d0b394eca4861e06d702458615a901491a16160a213b106b49e95131
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2382AE51_E38B_46FF_A150_DB470F0C78E2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I mean, talk about some ⟪k:1⟫fantastic⟪k:2⟫ news.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫You both pick the same day, but "
"you’ve got the dates different!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Piuttosto, perché non parliamo della notizia più sorprendente?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Avevate scelto "
"entrambi lo stesso giorno, ma le vostre date erano diverse!"

